1
00:00:03,055 --> 00:00:04,807
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:05,349 --> 00:00:07,935
<font color="white">如果你不願意相信我</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:08,019 --> 00:00:10,229
<font color="white">即使獨自一人，我也會去做</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:10,312 --> 00:00:11,772
<font color="white">進次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:13,858 --> 00:00:15,234
<font color="white">慢著！</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:15,317 --> 00:00:17,486
<font color="white">為什麼要阻止我？</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:18,529 --> 00:00:19,947
<font color="white">追了也沒用</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:20,531 --> 00:00:21,907
<font color="white">可惡！</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:02:24,738 --> 00:02:26,407
<font color="white">諸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:02:26,490 --> 00:02:27,992
<font color="white">進次郎他…</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:02:28,075 --> 00:02:29,910
<font color="white">我聽井手先生說了</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:02:29,994 --> 00:02:34,039
<font color="white">那麼身為看著他逃走的當事人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你有什麼看法？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:02:35,916 --> 00:02:39,044
<font color="white">我也需要一些時間整理思緒</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:43,549
<font color="white">我當然也很想相信進次郎所說的話</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:02:44,508 --> 00:02:47,469
<font color="white">可是他最近的樣子</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:48,053 --> 00:02:50,097
<font color="white">讓我搞不懂</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:50,639 --> 00:02:52,683
<font color="white">諸星先生覺得呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:53,392 --> 00:02:54,977
<font color="white">不好說</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:55,060 --> 00:02:57,146
<font color="white">那小子的事情先暫且不提</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:02:58,188 --> 00:03:02,109
<font color="white">外星人入侵科學特搜隊的目的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也很讓人在意</font></font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:07,197 --> 00:03:08,198
<font color="white">太郎</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:08,282 --> 00:03:10,784
<font color="white">可以麻煩你跟諸星一起過來嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:13,913 --> 00:03:16,332
<font color="white">要我們去帶回進次郎？</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:17,041 --> 00:03:19,710
<font color="white">也只能由我們親手帶他回來了</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:19,793 --> 00:03:22,755
<font color="white">總不能將他通緝</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:22,838 --> 00:03:26,926
<font color="white">我不認為進次郎現在這樣子</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">會坦率接受我們的說服</font></font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:27,927 --> 00:03:30,888
<font color="white">是啊，我十分明白</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:31,472 --> 00:03:34,433
<font color="white">那你的意思是…</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:03:35,100 --> 00:03:36,894
<font color="white">意思是若情況所需</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:36,977 --> 00:03:39,647
<font color="white">會准許我們動用武力嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:40,231 --> 00:03:42,191
<font color="white">雖然並非我們本意</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:03:42,816 --> 00:03:46,153
<font color="white">但那也是不得已的</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:46,237 --> 00:03:52,868
<font color="white">現在我們面臨的問題不只那一個</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:52,952 --> 00:03:55,371
<font color="white">我們必需做到的職責…</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:55,454 --> 00:03:56,288
<font color="white">（類別</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">梅菲斯特）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:03:56,372 --> 00:03:58,749
<font color="white">就是斷絕災難的根源</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:03:58,832 --> 00:04:00,000
<font color="white">（行蹤不明）</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:04:00,084 --> 00:04:01,627
<font color="white">也就是說</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:01,710 --> 00:04:05,005
<font color="white">我們要排除四名超人力霸王</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:05,756 --> 00:04:10,177
<font color="white">他說的“四名超人力霸王”是指…</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:04:10,928 --> 00:04:12,972
<font color="white">下落不明的早田</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:13,055 --> 00:04:15,724
<font color="white">還有進次郎顯然包含在內</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:16,517 --> 00:04:17,893
<font color="white">不過…</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:04:17,977 --> 00:04:20,312
<font color="white">剩下兩人到底是誰？</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:23,607 --> 00:04:25,234
<font color="white">總而言之</font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:04:25,317 --> 00:04:28,028
<font color="white">我要拜託你們盡快找出進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:28,112 --> 00:04:29,780
<font color="white">並且拘捕他</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:29,863 --> 00:04:33,200
<font color="white">這樣做也是為了保護他的安全</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:04:33,284 --> 00:04:34,785
<font color="white">-知道了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-知道了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:04:56,890 --> 00:04:59,018
<font color="white">對喔</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:04:59,101 --> 00:05:01,020
<font color="white">原來是那麼一回事</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:05:03,856 --> 00:05:05,774
<font color="white">好吧</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:05,858 --> 00:05:08,527
<font color="white">先冷靜下來整理現況</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:13,490 --> 00:05:15,242
<font color="white">不行啦</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:15,326 --> 00:05:18,620
<font color="white">發生太多事情，根本沒辦法理清思緒</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:05:27,421 --> 00:05:30,174
<font color="white">我到底在做什麼啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:05:39,433 --> 00:05:42,811
<font color="white">在我們鎖定的四名超人力霸王之中</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:05:42,895 --> 00:05:44,521
<font color="white">有兩名已經成功消滅了</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:45,564 --> 00:05:48,025
<font color="white">原本正好有機會多解決一個</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:05:48,108 --> 00:05:50,694
<font color="white">放他一條生路真的好嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:50,778 --> 00:05:52,863
<font color="white">妳別著急</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:52,946 --> 00:05:56,450
<font color="white">目前一切都按照我的劇本進行</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:57,201 --> 00:05:58,786
<font color="white">是嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:58,869 --> 00:06:04,083
<font color="white">所以若照著你的劇本</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">接著會如何發展啊？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:06:04,166 --> 00:06:07,836
<font color="white">妳只要繼續追蹤超人力霸王就好</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:10,172
<font color="white">不要說得那麼容易</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:06:10,255 --> 00:06:12,049
<font color="white">而且他到底在哪裡啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:06:12,132 --> 00:06:15,344
<font color="white">我早已做好對策了</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:17,721 --> 00:06:19,723
<font color="white">原來如此</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:19,807 --> 00:06:24,686
<font color="white">你利用外星人的聯絡網</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">徹底包圍了超人力霸王啊</font></font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:25,729 --> 00:06:30,234
<font color="white">那麼現在準備上演第二幕吧</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:06:41,495 --> 00:06:43,664
<font color="white">真的沒問題嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:43,747 --> 00:06:44,832
<font color="white">你是指什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:44,915 --> 00:06:47,167
<font color="white">昨天井手先生說的那些話</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:47,251 --> 00:06:50,921
<font color="white">不就等於是容忍</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王彼此互鬥嗎？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:51,004 --> 00:06:53,382
<font color="white">不管誰輸誰贏都無法輕易收場</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:54,091 --> 00:06:57,177
<font color="white">井手先生想必是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">深知那點才下判斷的吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:58,720 --> 00:06:59,847
<font color="white">有異議嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:59,930 --> 00:07:01,640
<font color="white">沒有</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:03,142 --> 00:07:05,269
<font color="white">只是做個最終確認而已</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:07,813 --> 00:07:09,857
<font color="white">需要加購袋子嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:07:09,940 --> 00:07:11,191
<font color="white">不用了</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:07:11,275 --> 00:07:13,110
<font color="white">結帳就用…</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:07:14,069 --> 00:07:15,696
<font color="white">我還是用現金好了</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:07:15,779 --> 00:07:17,781
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:23,620 --> 00:07:24,788
<font color="white">（佐山玲奈簽書會）</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:24,872 --> 00:07:25,873
<font color="white">（寫真散文集</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">《我的好天氣》）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:30,127 --> 00:07:31,253
{\an8}<font color="white">（找到匹配者</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">早田進次郎）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:31,336 --> 00:07:36,049
<font color="white">臉部辨識系統尋獲了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">疑似進次郎的人物</font></font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:36,133 --> 00:07:39,303
<font color="white">立刻查出詳細地點，派太郎前往</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:39,386 --> 00:07:40,596
<font color="white">了解</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:43,724 --> 00:07:45,100
<font color="white">便利商店內的監視器</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:45,184 --> 00:07:47,394
<font color="white">拍攝到可能是進次郎的人物</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:47,978 --> 00:07:50,314
<font color="white">地點是淡谷町三丁目</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:50,397 --> 00:07:52,024
<font color="white">準備部署無人機</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:08:05,954 --> 00:08:10,292
<font color="white">這支手機裡沒有玲奈小姐的聯絡方式</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:09:05,055 --> 00:09:07,224
<font color="white">（檢測到信號）</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:09:07,307 --> 00:09:10,394
<font color="white">進次郎手機內的全球定位系統啟動了</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:09:10,978 --> 00:09:13,272
<font color="white">在這時機啟動？</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:09:14,398 --> 00:09:16,108
<font color="white">不太對勁</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:09:16,608 --> 00:09:18,360
<font color="white">58號路線北方</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:09:18,443 --> 00:09:20,737
<font color="white">正以時速約50公里移動</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:09:21,863 --> 00:09:23,407
<font color="white">已經確認座標</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:09:23,490 --> 00:09:25,701
<font color="white">絕對沒有錯，就是這輛車</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:09:28,662 --> 00:09:31,164
<font color="white">麻煩停一下車！</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:09:35,168 --> 00:09:36,336
<font color="white">不好意思</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:09:36,420 --> 00:09:39,339
<font color="white">可以讓我檢查一下車斗嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:09:39,423 --> 00:09:42,050
<font color="white">-好，請便</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-謝謝</font></font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,437
<font color="white">諸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:56,106
<font color="white">我們好像被他發現了</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:09:56,189 --> 00:09:59,234
<font color="white">知道了，你先回來吧</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:10:00,944 --> 00:10:03,947
<font color="white">沒想到竟然會被那小子擺了一道</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:10:08,577 --> 00:10:09,911
<font color="white">辛苦你了</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:10:09,995 --> 00:10:11,204
<font color="white">妳也辛苦了</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:10:11,288 --> 00:10:12,914
<font color="white">等等，玲奈</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:10:15,584 --> 00:10:17,919
<font color="white">明天要在書店舉辦簽書會喔</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:10:18,003 --> 00:10:19,880
<font color="white">我10點會來接妳，再麻煩妳囉</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:10:19,963 --> 00:10:21,214
<font color="white">好的</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:10:21,298 --> 00:10:22,591
<font color="white">沒問題</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:10:22,674 --> 00:10:23,675
<font color="white">再見囉</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:10:49,284 --> 00:10:52,371
<font color="white">（通話紀錄</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">早田進次郎）</font></font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:11:01,046 --> 00:11:02,714
<font color="white">您撥的電話無人接聽</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:11:02,798 --> 00:11:07,386
<font color="white">該號碼可能在收訊範圍外</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">或是未開啟電源…</font></font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:11:39,543 --> 00:11:43,713
<font color="white">我們久違地好好聊一聊吧</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:11:43,797 --> 00:11:45,424
<font color="white">爸</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:11:46,049 --> 00:11:48,969
<font color="white">那時候到底想對我說什麼？</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:11:50,220 --> 00:11:52,222
<font color="white">你想做的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:11:52,305 --> 00:11:54,808
<font color="white">不就只是報仇嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:12:14,703 --> 00:12:18,081
<font color="white">（佐山玲奈簽書會）</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:12:22,252 --> 00:12:24,546
<font color="white">爸，你回家了啊</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:12:24,629 --> 00:12:27,549
<font color="white">喔，原來妳在啊，我回來了</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:12:32,429 --> 00:12:34,389
<font color="white">我看到妳上電視了</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:12:34,473 --> 00:12:35,640
<font color="white">那是怎麼回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:12:35,724 --> 00:12:38,518
<font color="white">這是什麼意思？那是我的工作啊</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:12:38,602 --> 00:12:40,812
<font color="white">竟然在這種時候上那種節目</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:12:40,896 --> 00:12:42,314
<font color="white">妳自己也知道會怎麼樣吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:12:42,397 --> 00:12:43,398
<font color="white">多替自己想一下</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:12:43,482 --> 00:12:47,819
<font color="white">所以意思是說</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你也覺得超人力霸王是壞人？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:12:47,903 --> 00:12:49,654
<font color="white">我才不管這件事</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:12:49,738 --> 00:12:51,156
<font color="white">你在說謊</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:12:51,823 --> 00:12:56,745
<font color="white">其實你明明就知道</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王不是壞人，對不對？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:12:57,329 --> 00:12:59,789
<font color="white">大家應該也是那麼認為的</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:12:59,873 --> 00:13:03,335
<font color="white">然而他們只因為好玩</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:13:03,418 --> 00:13:05,921
<font color="white">就隨口亂說些有的沒的</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:13:06,463 --> 00:13:07,964
<font color="white">太過分了</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:13:08,048 --> 00:13:10,300
<font color="white">我不曉得</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:13:10,383 --> 00:13:12,385
<font color="white">我只能這麼說</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:13:13,178 --> 00:13:17,265
<font color="white">總之妳不要再牽扯進</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">超人力霸王的事情了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:13:17,349 --> 00:13:20,227
<font color="white">竟然連妳的往事都被挖出來討論</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:13:29,361 --> 00:13:31,363
<font color="white">我說啊，爸</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:13:31,446 --> 00:13:32,447
<font color="white">什麼事？</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:13:33,031 --> 00:13:36,868
<font color="white">你從來沒有跟我說過媽媽的事情耶</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:13:37,869 --> 00:13:39,996
<font color="white">這是什麼意思？</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:13:40,872 --> 00:13:44,668
<font color="white">爸，如果我問你</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">為什麼要和媽媽結婚</font></font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:13:44,751 --> 00:13:46,628
<font color="white">你回答得出來嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:13:46,711 --> 00:13:48,421
<font color="white">誰會跟妳說那種事啊！</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:13:48,505 --> 00:13:49,714
<font color="white">我就說吧</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:13:49,798 --> 00:13:52,092
<font color="white">你什麼都不告訴我</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:13:54,302 --> 00:13:57,013
<font color="white">歸根究柢，所謂的男人啊</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:13:57,639 --> 00:13:59,349
<font color="white">只要碰上越想說的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:13:59,432 --> 00:14:01,935
<font color="white">就越開不了口啦</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:14:09,192 --> 00:14:11,403
<font color="white">（佐山玲奈簽書會）</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:14:11,486 --> 00:14:13,113
<font color="white">（《我的好天氣》）</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:14:13,196 --> 00:14:14,739
<font color="white">（佐山玲奈）</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:14:15,574 --> 00:14:17,158
<font color="white">今後也請妳繼續加油</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:14:17,242 --> 00:14:19,119
<font color="white">謝謝你</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:14:21,496 --> 00:14:23,582
<font color="white">下一位，請上前</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:14:31,798 --> 00:14:34,593
<font color="white">那個，對不起</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:14:34,676 --> 00:14:36,177
<font color="white">你別走！</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:14:41,099 --> 00:14:43,393
<font color="white">歸根究柢，所謂的男人啊</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:14:43,476 --> 00:14:44,978
<font color="white">只要碰上越想說的事情</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:14:45,061 --> 00:14:46,980
<font color="white">就越開不了口啦</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:14:56,031 --> 00:14:57,240
<font color="white">這本給你</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:15:02,370 --> 00:15:05,123
{\an8}<font color="white">（要一直保持這樣的你喔）</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:15:05,707 --> 00:15:07,083
<font color="white">要一直…</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:15:07,167 --> 00:15:10,128
<font color="white">保持這樣的你喔</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:12,213
<font color="white">謝謝你</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:15:14,007 --> 00:15:16,635
<font color="white">我以後也會為你加油的</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:15:18,845 --> 00:15:20,889
<font color="white">謝謝妳</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:15:32,692 --> 00:15:34,653
<font color="white">還沒找到人嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:15:34,736 --> 00:15:36,321
<font color="white">不要那樣催我嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:15:36,404 --> 00:15:38,740
<font color="white">科學特搜隊雖然比想像中還棘手</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:15:38,823 --> 00:15:41,451
<font color="white">不過我決定反過來利用他們</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:15:42,577 --> 00:15:43,745
<font color="white">所以啊</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:15:44,371 --> 00:15:47,123
<font color="white">這次我可以打倒他們沒關係吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:15:48,249 --> 00:15:51,086
<font color="white">就交給妳決定吧</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:15:56,883 --> 00:15:59,052
<font color="white">您好，這裡是早田家</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:16:01,054 --> 00:16:02,681
<font color="white">喂？</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:16:09,604 --> 00:16:11,231
<font color="white">是進次郎嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:16:14,359 --> 00:16:15,485
<font color="white">對</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:16:17,028 --> 00:16:18,947
<font color="white">你平安無事啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:16:21,366 --> 00:16:22,367
<font color="white">對</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:16:23,326 --> 00:16:25,161
<font color="white">有爸的消息嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:16:26,788 --> 00:16:32,210
<font color="white">聽說還無法確定他的安危</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:16:35,839 --> 00:16:37,507
<font color="white">媽</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:16:37,590 --> 00:16:39,467
<font color="white">怎麼了？</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:16:42,804 --> 00:16:44,264
<font color="white">如果我…</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:16:45,432 --> 00:16:46,474
<font color="white">沒事</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:16:47,225 --> 00:16:50,729
<font color="white">我可能有一陣子不能回家了</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:16:53,606 --> 00:16:55,442
<font color="white">我知道了</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:16:55,984 --> 00:16:58,278
<font color="white">難道妳都不擔心嗎？</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:16:58,361 --> 00:17:00,697
<font color="white">我當然會擔心啊</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:17:00,780 --> 00:17:04,617
<font color="white">不過如果是你的話一定沒問題</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:17:05,660 --> 00:17:07,787
<font color="white">我總有那種預感</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:17:10,415 --> 00:17:12,208
<font color="white">對了，進次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:17:12,292 --> 00:17:15,754
<font color="white">以前你爸吩咐過我</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">萬一他出了什麼事</font></font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:17:15,837 --> 00:17:19,215
<font color="white">就要我去一個地方</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:17:20,216 --> 00:17:22,677
<font color="white">等等，我準備紙條抄下來</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:17:38,568 --> 00:17:41,488
<font color="white">是這裡沒錯吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:18:08,556 --> 00:18:09,766
<font color="white">真有一套啊</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:18:09,849 --> 00:18:12,185
<font color="white">不愧是繼承者呢</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:18:12,268 --> 00:18:14,062
<font color="white">妳是誰？</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:18:14,145 --> 00:18:15,855
<font color="white">你們難道有規定</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:18:15,939 --> 00:18:19,025
<font color="white">不先自我介紹，要直接向對方發問？</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:19:02,068 --> 00:19:03,862
<font color="white">痛死了…</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:19:05,488 --> 00:19:08,533
<font color="white">竟然敢徒手接下我的攻擊</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:19:09,075 --> 00:19:11,995
<font color="white">你還挺有膽量的嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:19:12,078 --> 00:19:17,208
<font color="white">你那種有勇無謀的個性，我不討厭唷</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:19:52,452 --> 00:19:54,787
<font color="white">如果我有裝甲的話…</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:20:15,016 --> 00:20:16,726
<font color="white">哎呀</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:20:16,809 --> 00:20:19,395
<font color="white">太郎先生，為什麼你在這裡？</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:20:19,479 --> 00:20:22,899
<font color="white">進次郎，不要再逃下去了</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:20:22,982 --> 00:20:26,402
<font color="white">那樣的話我們也可以保護你</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:20:26,486 --> 00:20:29,030
<font color="white">實在是太麻煩了</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:20:29,113 --> 00:20:32,033
<font color="white">我就一次對付你們兩個吧</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:20:47,173 --> 00:20:49,842
<font color="white">別跑啊，進次郎！</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:20:57,141 --> 00:20:58,518
<font color="white">要是你敢東張西望</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:20:58,601 --> 00:20:59,894
<font color="white">我就先解決你</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:20:59,978 --> 00:21:02,647
<font color="white">上次我被妳單方面打得落花流水</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:21:02,730 --> 00:21:05,108
<font color="white">這次可不會讓妳得逞</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:21:07,193 --> 00:21:08,820
<font color="white">我們走著瞧</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:21:16,619 --> 00:21:18,538
<font color="white">到此為止了</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:21:19,038 --> 00:21:20,915
<font color="white">諸星先生</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:21:21,541 --> 00:21:24,752
<font color="white">跟你對打太費勁了</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:21:24,836 --> 00:21:26,546
<font color="white">乖乖就範吧</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:21:59,787 --> 00:22:02,165
<font color="white">很好，看來沒有追兵</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:22:03,124 --> 00:22:05,585
<font color="white">我還沒老到會輸給這群年輕人呢</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:22:05,668 --> 00:22:09,547
<font color="white">不過有特地去跟年輕人</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">較勁的心態就代表已經夠老了</font></font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:22:11,132 --> 00:22:13,051
<font color="white">請問你是誰？</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:22:13,134 --> 00:22:14,802
<font color="white">你該不會是…</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:22:16,471 --> 00:22:18,848
<font color="white">我叫嵐大助</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:22:18,931 --> 00:22:22,018
<font color="white">是科學特搜隊的前隊員</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:24:06,080 --> 00:24:09,167
<font color="white">字幕翻譯：江俊諺</font><font color="white"></font>

